talento, coragem e determina\u00e7\u00e3o, desafiam barreiras, criam novas oportunidades e <strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1058\">transformam o mundo todos os dias<\/strong>: <strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1112\">o nosso profundo respeito, admira\u00e7\u00e3o e gratid\u00e3o!<\/strong><\/p><p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1225\">Hoje e sempre, celebramos a vossa for\u00e7a, inspira\u00e7\u00e3o e lideran\u00e7a. <strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1219\">Feliz Dia Internacional da Mulher!<\/strong><\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>No Dia Internacional da Mulher, queremos prestar uma homenagem especial a todas as mulheres incr\u00edveis que fazem parte da Devlop! Hoje, celebramos n\u00e3o apenas as talentosas e dedicadas profissionais da nossa equipa \u2013 as nossas Devlops \u2013, mas tamb\u00e9m todas as mulheres que, com a sua for\u00e7a, determina\u00e7\u00e3o e esp\u00edrito inovador, deixam a sua marca [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":16102,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[88],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16112"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=16112"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16112\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":16117,"href":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16112\/revisions\/16117"}],"wp:feature